{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日だけど\nゆったんおめぺろ(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は生ドルだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストさんは\nアイドリング!!!さん、P-Girlsさん\nです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして乃木坂も出ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんらりんみおな！\nみんな生ドル経験者"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/21/9071536/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21時から！\n見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/21/9071536/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→http://nico.ms/lv228366131"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先月の生ドルの記事が上がってますので\n見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/21/9071536/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「川後が松村沙友理からレギュラー奪取宣言」\nhttp://news.dwango.jp/?itemid=23580"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー\n暑いですねえ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猛暑日だって！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、猛暑日きちゃう？って思ったけど\nそういえば7月も下旬なんですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時が経つの早いと本当に思う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな日にぴったりな\n飯ぺろを！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/21/9071536/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、フローズンフルーツバー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あちこちで紹介されてるから\n知ってる人も少なくないかもしれないけど\nPALETASってお店です( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、これ一人で2本食べたんじゃないよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はMix Eastってやつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/21/9071536/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママはPink Vanilla Mix"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/21/9071536/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田がMix East\nママがPink Vanilla Mix"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだよ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクだバニラだ\nママのがなんか頼んでるものが可愛い..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、\nMix Eastめっちゃおいしかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5種類のフルーツが\n大きめにカットされたまま入ってるから\nリンゴだ！キウイだ！オレンジの皮だ！\nって感じで一口一口\n違う味が楽しめるの！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/21/9071536/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い日に食べたくなるすっきりさ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、\nこの暑さも乗りきれそうだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/21/9071536/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/07/21/9071536/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケータイ大喜利のときの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぅ\nやっとブログ書けました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香に\n私とブログどっちが大事なの？って言われて\n妨害されてて書けなかったよ(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログって即答したんだけども。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}